@overheard command
// Writer (command), batch 3c. The bridge and the senior corridor: the night bridge, helm and comms, the senior officers.

== overheard
? pair:command+any time:night deck:1
A: Quiet night.
B: You always say that.
A: And I'm always reading. Chapter twelve.   #funny

? pair:helm+command deck:1
A: She's pulling left.
B: The console says she's straight.
A: The console hasn't flown her for twenty years.   #funny

? pair:comms+any deck:1
A: Relay's slow again.
B: How slow?
A: Twelve messages home, all waiting. And everyone asks me why.

? pair:senior+any deck:2
A: Did you read Gull this week?
B: The one about the airlock?
A: I can't stop thinking about it. Not in a good way.   #funny

? pair:command+command time:morning
A: Ninety seconds early.
B: Is that good?
A: For him, it's practically late.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 7: named pairs (who: is A, with: is B), placed where the talk belongs. Mostly not about work.
? pair:any+any who:kowalczyk with:vance deck:1 time:morning
A: Night log. Nothing happened.
B: Colour-coded?
A: Your bookmark's on page three.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:mensah with:vance act:gym
A: Treadmill board's got a new name.
B: Whose?
A: Tomas. Fourth.
B: He'll be third by Friday.

? pair:any+any who:nandakumar with:brennan place:mess
A: Too hot?
B: Much too hot.
A: You used all of them.
B: I'm brave.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:oduya with:brennan place:mess
A: The green sweets. No takers.
B: Put them in a pudding.
A: That's genius.
B: That's cooking.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:raman with:marrow deck:1
A: Six years. You've never grabbed the rail.
B: I've wanted to.
A: That's not the same thing.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:ferreira with:lindqvist-isak place:lounge
A: Have you met the new cadet yet?
B: Briefly. Quick on the board.
A: Good. You'll get on.

? pair:any+any who:zielinski-oona with:esposito-yara deck:3
A: Two for one?
B: One for one.
A: One and a half?
B: Fine. Today only.   #funny
